# Little Browser (Android): closing is final (docs/ux.md §6, §10), as on the desktop
# (desktop/patches/lb/no-reopen-closed*.patch). No Undo bar after closing tabs: their closing is
# committed straight after the tab model has announced it. No Recently closed list on the Recent
# tabs page, and no Ctrl+Shift+T.

